ions based on the results. It...</p><p class="reading-time"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fa fa-clock-o"></i> 11 min read <span class="arrow-position"><svg fill="currentColor" height="1.3rem" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewbox="0 0 512 512" width="1.3rem" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M295.6 163.7c-5.1 5-5.1 13.3-.1 18.4l60.8 60.9H124.9c-7.1 0-12.9 5.8-12.9 13s5.8 13 12.9 13h231.3l-60.8 60.9c-5 5.1-4.9 13.3.1 18.4 5.1 5 13.2 5 18.3-.1l82.4-83c1.1-1.2 2-2.5 2.7-4.1.7-1.6 1-3.3 1-5 0-3.4-1.3-6.6-3.7-9.1l-82.4-83c-4.9-5.2-13.1-5.3-18.2-.3z"></path></svg></span></p></a></li><li><a class="related-post-item" href="artificial-intelligence-in-vlsi-design"><h3 class="h3">Artificial Intelligence in VLSI Design</h3><p class="related-post-content">Introduction Indeed, artificial intelligence (AI) is now considered an evolutionizing power in almost every industry, and the impact on the Very Large Scale Integration (VLSI) design is profound and far-reaching. A foundation of modern electronics, VLSI design entails placing billions of transistors on a single chip, creating...</p><p class="reading-time"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fa fa-clock-o"></i> 7 min read <span class="arrow-position"><svg fill="currentColor" height="1.3rem" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewbox="0 0 512 512" width="1.3rem" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M295.6 163.7c-5.1 5-5.1 13.3-.1 18.4l60.8 60.9H124.9c-7.1 0-12.9 5.8-12.9 13s5.8 13 12.9 13h231.3l-60.8 60.9c-5 5.1-4.9 13.3.1 18.4 5.1 5 13.2 5 18.3-.1l82.4-83c1.1-1.2 2-2.5 2.7-4.1.7-1.6 1-3.3 1-5 0-3.4-1.3-6.6-3.7-9.1l-82.4-83c-4.9-5.2-13.1-5.3-18.2-.3z"></path></svg></span></p></a></li><li><a class="related-post-item" href="the-potential-of-artificial-intelligence-in-sharepoint-online"><h3 class="h3">The Potential of Artificial Intelligence in Sharepoint Online</h3><p class="related-post-content">The business world and the workplace itself are being revolutionized on a global level due to the rapid progress be